                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains the metadata of all the letters from the Epistolarium database (https://ckcc.huygens.knaw.nl/epistolarium/) which was downloaded from that site. During the SKILLNET project, we added the person mappings between the Epistolarium correspondents and the curated version of the Catalogus Epistolarum Neerlandicarum (CEN) (https://doi.org/10.34894/G8XQI0). This dataset includes the mapped person Ids."
                },
